{"unit_id":"Jiao-XXX__dsh-auto-approve#card-zh","repo":"Jiao-XXX/dsh-auto-approve","commit":"c6d4222746fef089de4e40063d05d26a4191bc66","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-approve 是 DeepSeek Harness 的 Web 插件，为 workspace-write 权限档加入 Sandboxed Auto。它通过审批请求瀑布流识别该档的沙箱升级，将命令证据交给配置的模型，并仅对明确批准的请求一次放行；危险规则命中、分类不确定或失败时交由人工审批。插件还提供会话内重复调用记忆、/auto-report 汇总，以及权限菜单图标适配。安装后可沿用 DSH 默认模型，也可设置分类模型与规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-33","index.js:494-699","client.js:164-215"]}
{"unit_id":"Jiao-XXX__dsh-auto-approve#card-en","repo":"Jiao-XXX/dsh-auto-approve","commit":"c6d4222746fef089de4e40063d05d26a4191bc66","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-approve adds a Sandboxed Auto preset to DeepSeek Harness. It asks the configured model to classify sandbox escalations and grants only exact approvals once; other outcomes go to human review. It remembers repeated calls per session and provides an /auto-report summary.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-33","index.js:494-699","client.js:164-215"]}
